<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Airlines cancels flights.</title>
<headline>Philippine Airlines cancels flights.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Airlines Inc said on Monday it cancelled all its outgoing international flights until midnight due to bad weather conditions.</p>
<p>It also cancelled its domestic flights since the morning.</p>
<p>A tropical depression off the main island of Luzon had caused flooding and forced the government to close offices in the capital and suspend trading in the country's financial markets.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
